<title>GERMANY: GERMAN DATA DUE-NRW March CPI data due Monday PM.</title>
<headline>GERMAN DATA DUE-NRW March CPI data due Monday PM.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The statistics office of the German state of North Rhine-Westphalia said on Monday it would publish its March cost of living index some time on Monday afternoon.</p>
<p>In February, the state's CPI index gained 0.5 percent month-on-month.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
